# Phase 4, GA-2-11's CONTROL (2026-10-14): HEAD's engine (6492c537 - the household burden reads the live line's sub-rows on both sides) under the
# harness that carries X-02S (the income tax's adjustable sub-rows at their dials' floor, the lever left standing) and the BURDEN readout (the burden
# and its gap from the seed's statute, logged with each TAXES line). Expected: each X-02S run's sub-row bill, where it passes, takes the income tax's
# revenue down and leaves the gap where it stood - the finding, measured; the eight p4_scen runs byte-identical to their p4_scen twins - the readout
# moves nothing; area 2 the twin set for the fix's own run (p4_ga2_11).
#
# --- the repro: X-02S in the five countries whose income tax responds ---
